From: =?UTF-8?q?Jos=C3=A9=20Miguel=20Calder=C3=B3n=20de=20la=20Barca?=
 <83497667+fxjosemi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 05:54:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] drm/i915: add Galaxy Book 12 AMOLED backlight support
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Use the panel private AUX protocol and its factory calibration data to
expose native brightness control on the Galaxy Book 12 AMOLED panel.
Restrict the quirk to matching Samsung DMI and panel IDs, and retain
PWM as a safe fallback.

Signed-off-by: José Miguel Calderón de la Barca <83497667+fxjosemi@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 Makefile                                 |    1 +
 display/intel_backlight.c                |    6 +
 display/intel_display_types.h            |    3 +
 display/intel_dp_samsung_amoled.c        |  619 +++++++++++++
 display/intel_dp_samsung_amoled.h        |   11 +
 display/intel_dp_samsung_amoled_tables.h | 1072 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 1712 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 display/intel_dp_samsung_amoled.c
 create mode 100644 display/intel_dp_samsung_amoled.h
 create mode 100644 display/intel_dp_samsung_amoled_tables.h

